{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Next Step", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Media Kit", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "  Express duty, advice, willingness, or intention to do something in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Reason Clauses: Due to, because of, owing to <br/>Result Clauses: So ... that", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to introduce a reason for a particular situation, you can use the following prepositions: <ul><li>Because of </li><li> Due to </li><li>Owing to", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"underline\"><span class=\"italic\">because of </span></span>    before a noun or a noun phrase.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br><span class=\"italic\">We won't be able to make it <span class=\"strong\">because of the weather</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\"><span class=\"italic\">Due to</span></span> and <span class=\"underline\"><span class=\"italic\">owing to</span></span> also mean <span class=\"italic\">because of</span>. They sound a little more formal, and are therefore more common in professional English rather than conversational.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br><span class=\"italic\">She was unable to attend the meeting <span class=\"strong\">due to a previous engagement</span>.</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\">We have less money to spend <span class=\"strong\">owing to the budget cuts</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you want to link a cause with a result, you can use <span class=\"underline\"><span class=\"italic\">so ... that</span></span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br><span class=\"italic\">The bus was <span class=\"strong\">so </span>hot <span class=\"strong\">that </span>I felt sick the whole way!</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br><span class=\"italic\">It all happened so <span class=\"strong\">quickly </span>that I never had a chance to fully absorb what was going on.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In formal English, you can put <span class=\"italic\">So ... that</span> at the beginning of the sentence and put the verb before the object.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">So hot was the bus that</span> I felt sick the whole way.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It has to be done quickly due to the looming release date next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It was so interesting that I'd like to focus on writing media kits. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sometimes it's hard to stand out in this industry, owing to the volume of competition.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The small publishers sometimes get overlooked because of the ubiquity of the large ones.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Testimonials are so influential that I'd like to try to get five in our media kit. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Creating a Media Kit", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "What is a media kit?<br/>A package of information assembled by a company to provide basic information about itself to reporters.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "How do you create a media kit? <br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>First you write an introduction of who you are, in this case the author and the title of the book. </li><li>Next include a mission or manifesto to differentiate your business or product from the competition and explaining what the business stands for.</li><li>Next include some factual information about the product, or book.</li><li>Add in a couple of  illustrations so people can see how beautiful they are.</li><li> Put in some testimonials or quotes from people saying how great they think the product is.</li><li>The last section should include the price list and contact information for bookstores, libraries or schools that want to order the book from the publisher.</li><li>It needs to be in PDF form, so converting to PDF is the last step.</li>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "looming", "type": "name"}, {"content": "about to \u200bhappen \u200bsoon and \u200bcausing \u200bworry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  It has to be done quickly due to the looming release date next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about customer relations.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "media kit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a package of information assembled by a company to provide basic information about itself to reporters", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  How are you coming along with the media kit for the book?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "manifesto", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a public declaration of policy and aims", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Next you can include a mission or manifesto to differentiate your business or product from the competition and explaining what the business stands for. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to differentiate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "recognize the difference(s)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's important to differentiate between your mission and your vision.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to stand for", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to support particular values or principles", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I put in a statement about what the publisher stands for.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to stand out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be seen or noticed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: sometimes it's hard to stand out in this industry,", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to overlook", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go unnoticed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The small publishers sometimes get overlooked because there are so many large ones.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ubiquity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the state of being everywhere all the time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Independent stores struggle against the ubiquity of the larger chains.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose any product to create a media kit.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Follow the steps outlined in the lesson to create a media kit for your product. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a draft copy of your media kit on paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your media kit to your class. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to the other presentations. Which product do you want to buy based on its media kit?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I use follow the steps to create a media kit.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I create a draft media kit for a product.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present my media kit to a group.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to media kit presentations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I choose a product to buy based on the media kit.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le15ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le15ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>\t\tHow are you coming along with the media kit for the book? It has to be done quickly due to the looming release date next week.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tYes. It will be ready. I had never done one before so I did some research and looked at a lot of examples. It was so interesting that I'd like to focus on writing media kits.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>  \t\tI've never done one either. What do you put in it?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tWell, first you write an introduction of who you are, in this case the author and the title of the book. Next you can include a mission or manifesto to differentiate your business or product from the competition and explaining what the business stands for. I put in a statement about what the publisher stands for.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>\t\tYes, sometimes it's hard to stand out in this industry, owing to the volume of competition.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tThe small publishers sometimes get overlooked because of the ubiquity of the large ones. We have to get noticed somehow. Next I put in some factual information about the product, our book. I described the content, illustrations, why it was written and who it was written for.\nI added in a couple illustrations so people can see how beautiful they are. Next you should put in some testimonials or quotes from people saying how great they think the product is. Once I get some testimonials from other authors saying that they love the book, I'll add those in. Testimonials are so influential that I'd like to try to get five in our media kit.", "id": 2, "time": "35500"}, {"image": "engenn11le15ob05re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span> \t\tSounds great Adam! So is that the last part?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam:</span>  \t\tYeah. I still need to add in the testimonials and then the last section is the price list and contact information for bookstores, libraries or schools that want to order the book from the publisher. It needs to be in PDF form, so converting to PDF is the last step.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span>  \t\tI'm looking forward to seeing the finished product.", "id": 3, "time": "80200"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk or report about things, actions, events, or people related to work and job issues.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss reasons and results of an event or action related to work and jobs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can exchange complex professional information related to work and job issues.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What types of promotion or advertising do you think are the most effective?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " If you were going to try to sell a new product how would you advertise it to buyers?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " It's all about promotion!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nAdam <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">has an eye for</span> promotion. \n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content":